{
  "name": "@adjudicate/adjudicant",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Inspector-General observer plane (Adjudicant): a write-isolated, read-only governance console. Mounts the admin-sdk READ-ONLY router (every authorize/weaken mutation structurally excluded) — it observes, investigates, and (later) escalates; it never authorizes or weakens a decision.",
